    "text": {
     "en": "Markets can be weekly markets, shops, malls and online markets. Wholesale markets sell in bulk and retail markets sell to customers.\nPrice depends on supply and demand. When many people want a thing but few are available the price rises.\nConsumers should check quality and price and ask for a bill."
    }
